COTTONBEBE baby mobile for crib 
Soft and skin-friendly, fabric is made of 60% cotton + 40% bamboo fiber; 
3 modes: 360 degree rotation + music, music only, rotation only; 
35 soothing lullabies with volume control，automatically turn off music after 30 minutes；
Easy installation with a sturdy crib clamp (no tools required)
Crafted with safety and style in mind, the mobile for crib includes an adjustable arm that securely attaches to most cribs, keeping it safely out of reach while offering a mesmerizing view for your baby.
